                                "en": "My phone is <w>constantly</w> ringing; I don't have a moment of peace.",
                                "nl": "Mijn telefoon gaat <w>telkens</w> over, ik heb geen moment rust.",
                                "de": "Mein Telefon klingelt <w>dauernd</w>, ich habe keine Minute Ruhe.",
